libdtfl -- authors and contributors

Founding contributors

	Greg Burd <greg@burd.me>

Acknowledgements

	libdtfl is a port of three Rust projects.  It ports working code,
	algorithms, comments, and tests from each; every ported source file
	carries the upstream copyright notice in its provenance header, and
	COPYING carries the project notices.

	timely dataflow
		Frank McSherry and the Timely Dataflow contributors.
		https://github.com/TimelyDataflow/timely-dataflow

	differential dataflow
		Frank McSherry and the Differential Dataflow contributors.
		https://github.com/TimelyDataflow/differential-dataflow

	timely diagnostics
		The Timely Dataflow contributors.
		https://github.com/TimelyDataflow/diagnostics
